WEBVTT

00:01:30.688 --> 00:01:32.976
Suratlarida tabassum qilmagan o’yinchilar

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.976
o’rtacha atigi 72,9 yil umr ko’rganlar.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.581
aksincha yuzida shodon tabassumi bo’lgan

00:01:38.605 --> 00:01:40.976
o’yinchilar o’rtacha 80 yil yashaganlar.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.391
(Kulgu)

00:01:43.415 --> 00:01:46.240
Yaxshi xabar shundaki, 
biz jilmayib dunyoga kelamiz.

00:01:46.558 --> 00:01:48.543
3D Ultraovoz texnologiyasidan foydalanib,

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:52.145
hozirda rivojlanayotgan bolaning hatto 
ona qornida jilmayib

00:01:52.169 --> 00:01:53.319
turganini kuzata olamiz.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:56.976
Ular dunyoga kelib ham jilmayishda 
davom etadilar--

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.976
dastavval, ko’pincha uyqusida.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.976
Va hattoki ojiz go’daklar ham